  "plain": "David Grusch, a whistleblower interviewed on a podcast in 2023, says that reports from the Air Force Office of Special Investigations, the Air Force's internal investigative arm, described objects in the 1950s that looked like flying butane tanks. He compares them to the Tic Tac, a white oval object shaped like the mint that Navy pilots reported in recent years, saying the Tic Tac of today was the flying butane tank of the 1950s, which would mean the same kind of craft has been seen for decades."
